1
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:31,000
Two worlds collide. One survives.

2
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:56,000
Transformers: The Last Knight is a action, adventure,
science fiction film directed by Michael Bay.

3
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:21,000
Humans and Transformers are at war.

4
00:25:40,000 --> 00:25:46,000
Optimus Prime is gone.

5
00:32:05,000 --> 00:32:11,000
The key to saving our future lies buried in the secrets of the
past, in the hidden history of Transformers on Earth.

6
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:36,000
Saving our world falls upon the shoulders of an unlikely alliance: Cade
Yeager; Bumblebee; an English Lord; and an Oxford Professor.

7
00:44:55,000 --> 00:45:01,000
Cade Yeager, played by Mark Wahlberg.

8
00:51:20,000 --> 00:51:26,000
Viviane Wembly, played by Laura Haddock.

9
00:57:45,000 --> 00:57:51,000
Optimus Prime (voice), played by Peter Cullen.

10
01:04:10,000 --> 01:04:16,000
Sir Edmund Burton, played by Anthony Hopkins.

11
01:10:35,000 --> 01:10:41,000
Bumblebee (voice), played by Erik Aadahl.

12
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
Colonel William Lennox, played by Josh Duhamel.

13
01:23:25,000 --> 01:23:31,000
Transformers: The Last Knight is a 2017 American science fiction
action film based on Hasbro's Transformers toy line.

14
01:29:50,000 --> 01:29:56,000
It is the fifth in the Transformers film series.

15
01:36:15,000 --> 01:36:21,000
The film was directed by Michael Bay and written by Art
Marcum, Matt Holloway, and Ken Nolan.

16
01:42:40,000 --> 01:42:46,000
It stars Mark Wahlberg reprising his role from Age of Extinction, while
Josh Duhamel reprises his role from the first three films.

17
01:49:05,000 --> 01:49:11,000
Stanley Tucci returns as a different character after also appearing in
Age of Extinction, with Anthony Hopkins joining the cast.

18
01:55:30,000 --> 01:55:36,000
In the film, inventor Cade Yeager is gifted a Talisman by a dying Transformer knight, and is soon recruited by an
eccentric British professor to save the world from the impending threat of a Cybetronian Sorceress.

19
02:01:55,000 --> 02:02:01,000
Transformers: The Last Knight premiered on June 18, 2017, at the Odeon Luxe Leicester Square in
London and was released in the United States on June 21, by Paramount Pictures.

20
02:08:20,000 --> 02:08:26,000
The film received generally negative reviews from critics, and grossed $605 million against a production budget
between $217–260 million and losing Paramount an estimated $100 million on the theatrical release.

21
02:14:45,000 --> 02:14:51,000
It was followed by a prequel, Bumblebee, in 2018.

22
02:21:10,000 --> 02:21:16,000
The film explores themes of england, chosen one,
based on toy, knight, giant robot.

23
02:27:35,000 --> 02:27:41,000
The tone is thought_provoking.
